00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:30.590
But just like a normal upper middle class
17 year old who goes to a good school that

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:34.270
doesn't know you have to be 18 to vote, it's
just not believable.

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:35.720
This is even less believable.

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:37.820
I thought I could vote in both places.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:40.620
I thought I could vote twice.

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.690
What?

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:43.830
That doesn't make any sense.

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:49.050
Even weirder is that bonanza called the plea
a fair resolution, but said the case raised

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:54.220
unanswered questions about whether Christie
