00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:14.710
So the New Hampshire vote wasn't fraudulent.

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:17.640
It wasn't part of planning to vote twice.

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:23.600
His mom gave him the idea by saying, you know,
I saw you're still registered in Massachusetts

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:24.600
