Give me a break, guys.

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:36.250
Now, I think it's very important to to issue
one other reminder here.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:46.590
We on the left who care about facts should
distinguish from between when they lie versus

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:50.840
when they tell the truth about something that's
not actually a problem.

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:52.690
So what do I mean by that?

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:56.100
They would spread the lie after 2020.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.360
Tons of dead people voted.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:02.260
Okay, well, no, actually, dead people didn't
vote.

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:08.870
What they often mean by that is a live people
go and they say, my name is such and such

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:11.370
and it's the name of a dead person.

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:15.650
And they vote in that person's name, number
one, that hasn't happened.

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:19.720
Number two, it's a really bad way to win an
