00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:34.180
However, it sometimes happens that someone
fills out and sends in an absentee ballot.

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:39.940
Legally, they're alive, then they die before
Election Day.

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:41.200
Okay.

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:43.920
That is a clerical issue.

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:45.560
They've not done anything against the law.

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:48.170
They were alive when they sent in their absentee
