00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:50.230
Here's another example.

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:51.490
People voted twice.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:55.270
Well, when sometimes people actually vote
twice.

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:56.560
We find out it's a Republican.

00:05:56.560 --> 00:06:00.430
And we found it recently with some Trump supporters
