00:06:00.430 --> 00:06:01.840
We found it with this guy.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:07.450
However, sometimes what they mean is, Hey,
we found someone who's registered in two places.

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:08.740
That's not a crime.

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:09.950
That's a clerical issue.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:13.630
As long as you only vote in one place, it's
not a big deal.

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:19.610
When I moved to New York from Massachusetts,
there was a period of time where I was still

00:06:19.610 --> 00:06:21.880
